    xp:text "In the building areas, advertising installations are only permitted at the place of performance and only up to a maximum of the window parapet of the second full storey. In the other special area, advertising installations above the window parapet of the second full storey may be permitted as an exception. Alternating or moving light for advertising installations is not permitted." .

