<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_043137EB-75FE-49F5-AFA4-23C21E26F4CA> a xp:Regulation ;
    gml:id "GML_043137EB-75FE-49F5-AFA4-23C21E26F4CA" ;
    xp:key "2.2" ;
    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:text "In the general residential areas WA1, WA7, WA8 and WA9, the permissible floor area may be exceeded by the floor areas of ancillary facilities within the meaning of § 14 of the Building Use Ordinance (Baunutzungsverordnung) and structural facilities below the ground surface which merely build underneath the building plot, up to a floor area figure of of 0.7 may be exceeded. In the general residential areas WA2, WA3 and WA4, the permissible floor area by the floor areas of ancillary facilities within the meaning of § 14 of the of the Building Use Ordinance (Baunutzungsverordnung) and structural installations below ground level, the building plot, up to a maximum floor area of 0.75 %. may be exceeded. In the general residential areas WA1, WA7, WA8 and WA9, the permissible floor area may be exceeded by the floor areas of ancillary facilities within the meaning of § 14 of the Building Use Ordinance (Baunutzungsverordnung) and structural facilities below the ground surface which merely build underneath the building plot, up to a floor area figure of of 0.7 may be exceeded" .

