    xp:text "In the building areas, vegetation-covered evaporation beds are to be be created. The plantings are to be maintained and replanted if they are lost. The evaporation beds must have an area of at least 4.0 m² per 100.0 m² of roof area and a minimum depth of roof area and a minimum depth of 30 cm." .

