<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_95F0C9BD-9118-47E6-B2D0-4444BC36458E> a xp:Regulation ;
    gml:id "GML_95F0C9BD-9118-47E6-B2D0-4444BC36458E" ;
    xp:key "2.5" ;
    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:text "In the building areas, a minimum height of 3.0 m is specified for the lower edge of the ceiling of the first full storey. The reference point is the height of the finished floor on the street side in accordance with text stipulation 2.4. Deviating from this, within the areas B1 - B2 - B3 - B4 - B1, C3 - C4 - C5 - C6 - C3, D3 - D4 - D6 - D7 - D3, E3 - E4 - E5 - E11 - E3, E1 - E2 - E9 - E10 - E1, F6 - F7 - F9 - F1 - F2 - F10 - F6, G2 - G3 - G7 - G5 - G6 - G1 - G2, H2 - H8 - H9 - H1 - H2, I7 - I8 - I9 - I12 - I7, I2 - I10 - I11 - I1 - I2, J4 - J5 - J6 - J3 - J4 and J2 - J9 - J10 - J1 - J2 for the lower edge of the ceiling of the first full storey a height of 6.15 m is set as the minimum dimension. This does not apply to gallery levels. Gallery levels are permitted at a distance of at least 4.8 m set back behind the building boundaries on the street side." .

