    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:text "E2 - E1 - E10 - E9 - E8" .

<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_D8EEE84A-26FD-4A1D-8260-8AD4D82E770A> a xp:Regulation ;
    gml:id "GML_D8EEE84A-26FD-4A1D-8260-8AD4D82E770A" ;
    xp:key "2.6" ;
    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:text "In the building areas WA1, WA2, WA3 and WA4, a protrusion of building parts, namely for oriels and balconies, in Front of the street-side building boundary up to the line delimiting the scope of deviations pursuant to Section 23 (3) Sentence 3 of the Building Use Ordinance from the second full storey and on up to 30% of the outer wall areas may be permitted as an exception." .

<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_DB370BF5-60CA-47F7-83DA-86E6BD138E33> a xp:DeterminationAccordingToStateLaw ;
    geo:hasDefaultGeometry <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_DB370BF5-60CA-47F7-83DA-86E6BD138E33/geo> ;
    gml:id "GML_DB370BF5-60CA-47F7-83DA-86E6BD138E33" ;
    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:text "I6 - I5 - I4 - I3 - I2 - I1" .

<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_E3D38F53-A58A-4499-A509-7CD1A63BDBA9> a xp:Regulation ;
    gml:id "GML_E3D38F53-A58A-4499-A509-7CD1A63BDBA9" ;
    xp:key "4.2" ;
    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:text "For protection against traffic noise, in the building areas, the following must be provided - in dwellings with one or two recreation rooms in at least one recreation room, - in dwellings with more than two living rooms in at least half of the living rooms sound level differences must be achieved by means of special window constructions or other structural measures of equal effect, which ensure that a rating level of 30 dB(A) is not exceeded during nighttime in the room or rooms with at least one partially opened window." .

<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_E47AACC0-D587-4FBB-AA14-A9B55CF79F41> a xp:Regulation ;
    gml:id "GML_E47AACC0-D587-4FBB-AA14-A9B55CF79F41" ;
    xp:key "7.1" ;
    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:text "The classification of the road traffic area and special purpose traffic areas is not the subject of the determination. Notes When applying the textual provisions 5.1, 5.4, 5.5 and 5.9, the use of species following planting list is recommended." .

<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_E5B583D6-E61F-4F71-ADCC-7BB068C74173> a xp:DeterminationAccordingToStateLaw ;
    geo:hasDefaultGeometry <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_E5B583D6-E61F-4F71-ADCC-7BB068C74173/geo> ;
