<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_E70B2FFE-B3D5-4B1F-8B51-9B8EEC5506FB> a xp:ImmissionProtection ;
    geo:hasDefaultGeometry <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_E70B2FFE-B3D5-4B1F-8B51-9B8EEC5506FB/geo> ;
    gml:id "GML_E70B2FFE-B3D5-4B1F-8B51-9B8EEC5506FB" ;
    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:use "To protect against traffic noise, in buildings in the general residential areas, at least one living room in flats with one or two living rooms or at least half of the living rooms with more than two living rooms must each have at least one window facing away from the street." .

<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_E9688651-1CBA-4B01-924C-3ADCB8E419FD> a xp:Regulation ;
    gml:id "GML_E9688651-1CBA-4B01-924C-3ADCB8E419FD" ;
    xp:key "2.3" ;
    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:text "In the building areas, installations for the use of solar radiation energy and biodiversity roofs within the meaning of textual regulation 5.1 are permissible above the above the defined upper edge, which are set back from the building boundaries at an angle of inclination of no more than set back from the building boundaries. In the general residential areas other technical roof structures may be permitted as an exception if they do not exceed a height of 2.5 m above the specified upper edge and if they are set back at an angle of inclination of a maximum of 45° behind the building boundaries. In the other special area, other technical roof structures may be permitted by way of exception if they do not exceed a height of 4.5 m above the specified upper edge and if they are structurally enclosed" .

<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_EA7B4E9E-82D8-4275-912A-12CDD4ADBF52> a xp:Regulation ;
    gml:id "GML_EA7B4E9E-82D8-4275-912A-12CDD4ADBF52" ;
    xp:key "5.8" ;
    xp:plan <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_c1979111-6f94-4f90-a7ad-d8061446d21e> ;
    xp:text "The precipitation water accumulating on the roof surfaces within the general residential areas, insofar as it cannot be completely retained and evaporated on the roof surfaces, is to be directed into evaporation beds. Insofar as it cannot be retained and evaporated in these either, it shall be infiltrated by means of trough or trough-rigol systems or other measures of equal effect. The precipitation water accumulating on the roof surfaces within the other special area, insofar as it cannot be completely retained on the roof surfaces and evaporated, shall be infiltrated by trough or trough-rigole systems or other measures of equal effect. The precipitation water occurring within the construction areas outside the roof surfaces, insofar as it cannot be completely retained and evaporated, is to be infiltrated by trough or trough-rigol systems or other measures of equal effect." .

<https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_EF4B23AB-3959-4D79-8B46-F0B31557F510> a xp:DeterminationAccordingToStateLaw ;
    geo:hasDefaultGeometry <https://graphdb.example.com/resource/places/GML_EF4B23AB-3959-4D79-8B46-F0B31557F510/geo> ;
